1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Against the humiliating bondage of a thousand years,

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Rapacity came from afar to subjugate them for a hundred years.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Against the cynical malice in the shape,

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Of neo-colonialism and its pretty local servants.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Many gave in and certain others resisted.

6
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:52,000
But the frustrations, the successes, the sweat, the blood,

7
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Have fortified our courageous people and fertilized its heroic struggle.

8
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:09,000
And one single night has drawn together, the history of an entire people.

9
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:18,000
And one single night has launched its triumphal march.

10
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Towards the horizon of good fortune, one single night has brought together,

11
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Our people, with all the peoples of the world, in the acquisition of liberty and progress, Motherland or death, we shall conquer!